ick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  17 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 17 00 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast mass   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm piece of yellow fibrofatty tissue  which is inked and sectioned to reveal hard  white  stellate REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm mass  approaching to within less than 0 1cm of the inked resection margin  Specimen is sectioned and submitted entirely in cassettes A through J  Resident  RHONDA YANTISS  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1   BREAST  LEFT   GROSSLY SUSPICIOUS FOR CARCINOMA  NOT LARGE ENOUGH TO FREEZE  O R  Resident  DAVID SABLE  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Lawrence R  Zukerberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Robert Gerdes Ojemann  M D  Michael Ned Margolies  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Unchecked.
