es P T  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast lumpectomy  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm oriented portion of breast parenchyma  The anterior surface is inked blue and the posterior surface is inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal all scattered firm fibrous parenchyma without any dominant mass lesion  Representative sections from the superior lateral portion of the specimen are submitted into cassettes U X  Representative sections from the inferior medial portion of the specimen which has an irregular and brown firm parenchyma is submitted into cassettes Y CC  Representative section from surrounding grossly unremarkable breast parenchyma is submitted into cassettes DD FF  Resident  PAUL MICHAELS  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLA   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  LEFT  SUPERIOR 1 2   FINAL SHAVED MARGIN PART C  BREAST  LEFT  INFERIOR 1 2   FINAL SHAVED MARGIN PART D  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Unchecked.
