ssay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  02 AUG 96 at 08 59 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number and  right modified radical mastectomy  is a right breast measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm with an overlying skin ellipse measuring REMOVED_DATE x 5 0cm with a 3 x 3cm areola and nipple and an attached REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm axillary tail  A REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm ill defined white  hard mass located centrally in the tissue is identified  The mass is located 1 0cm below the skin and 0 4cm from the deepest resection margin which is the closest resection margin  The remaining parenchyma is unremarkable  The largest axillary lymph node measures 2 0cm in diameter and is firm and pin  SECTION CODE A  Tumor and closest margin  deep   B F  Tumor mass closest margin  deep   G L  Lymph nodes  Resident  ALEXANDER KRATZ  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Janey Pratt  M D  Armaghan A Mostafavi  M D  PART   BREAST  MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Unchecked.
