en  O R  further representative sections of the lateral portion of the specimen  Resident  AARON CAPLAN  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1 AND  2  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLARY SENTINEL   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  O R  Resident  LAN WANG  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Andrew Eric Rosenberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODES LEFT AXILLARY SENTINEL 1 2  EXCISION PART B  BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
