ry parenchyma is present  This rubbery parenchyma extends to 0 4cm from the deepest margin  to 2cm from the medial resection margin  and 3cm from the axillary tail  The remaining parenchyma is soft  yellow  lobulated  The nipple is retracted  The axillary nodes are as large as 1 2cm in diameter and soft  tan  Section Code A B   mass C   deepest resection margin adjacent to the cavity  D G   other closest margins from the remaining firm areas  H   representative medial rubbery area  I   representative central rubbery area near cavity  J   representative central rubbery area away from the cavity  K   representative lateral rubbery area near the axillary portion  L   nipple  M   skin through the incision  N Q   nodes from axillary tail Resident  Metin Ozdemirli  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Herbert Charles Hoover Jr   M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST AND AXILLARY CONTENTS   report_end  , Unchecked.
