reen  lateral yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm hemorrhagic cavity  consistent with prior biopsy site  located 0 4cm from the medial margin  1 9cm from the lateral margin  0 9cm from the anterior margin  1 4cm from the posterior margin  1 2cm from the superior margin  and 1 0cm from the inferior margin  There is also a metal clip located 1 1cm medial to the previously described biopsy site  The remainder of the specimen consists of unremarkable fibroadipose tissue and fibrous breast parenchyma  The specimen is submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entirely submitted biopsy cavity  with the area where the metal clip was found in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Fibrous breast parenchyma superior to biopsy site   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Fibrous breast parenchyma inferior to biopsy site  from superior to inferior   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Superior margin  en face   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Inferior margin  en face   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional representative sections  Final Diagnosis by Ronald Balassanian M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   Breast  Right   Excision  report_end  , Unchecked.
