pse and a 5 x 2cm underlying piece of skeletal muscle with an attached 8 x 6 x 1 5cm axillary tail  In the skin  there is a palpable tumor measuring REMOVED_DATE x 7cm that protrudes 2cm above the skin surface  It is inked and sectioned to reveal an 8 x REMOVED_DATE x 3cm firm  white mass that is 0 1cm from the deep  closest  margin  The medial inferior margin is frozen as FX  1  now resubmitted as A  SECTION CODE B  Section of tumor at the closest deep margin  C E  Three additional representative sections of the mass  F  White  rubbery area that is separate from the tumor mass  G  Another representative section of the rubbery  white area  H  Representative section of unremarkable breast tissue away from the tumor mass and the rubbery  white mass  Multiple lymph nodes are dissected and submitted in cassettes I  J  and K  J represents one lymph node   Labeled  deep margin  is a 1 x REMOVED_DATE x 5cm fragment of breast tissue  Inked entirely in black and sectioned to reveal unremarkable skeletal muscle  Submitted entirely in cassettes L through R  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast mass  is a 5 x 11 x 17cm mastectomy specimen containing a 8 x 15cm skin ellipse containing a central 4 x 4cm nipple with a 1 x 1cm firm retracted area on the superior side of the nipple  The deep margin is inked black  The specimen is sectioned to reveal a 1 x 2 x 2cm ill defined  firm  white area which comes to 0 3cm of the closest  deep  resection margin  Sectioning the remainder of the breast reveals a separate 1 x 1 x 1 5cm firm  ill defined area approximately 3cm lateral to the first mass which comes to 0 4cm of the closest  deep  resection margin  The remainder of the parenchyma is unremarkable  SECTION CODE S  Mass at closest resection margin  T V  Representative sections of the mass  U mass in relation to skin at puckered area of nipple   W  Second mass at the closest  deep  resection margin  X  Representative unremarkable br